03-02). Among the biggest decliners, shares of McDonald's Corp (http://www.marketwatch.com/story/mcdonalds-price-target-slashed-after-slow-start-to-1-2-3-menu-2018-03-02). (MCD) dropped 2.8%, Nike Inc. (NKE) shed 2.0%, UnitedHealth Group Inc. (UNH) lost 1.5% and Apple Inc. (AAPL) gave up 1.4%. Dow futures dropped 264 points, following the Dow's 420-point plunge on Thursday.\n-Tomi Kilgore; 0824ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/mcdonalds-price-target-slashed-after-slow-start-to-1-2-3-menu-2018-03-02).", "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/us-stocks-set-to-pick-up-on-selloff-as-trade-war-fears-rattle-investors-2018-03-02)."], "published": "2018-03-02T02:00:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-03-02T16:19:03.005+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}